WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.497
Open a new temporary chat and upload the chapter PDF.

00:00:04.497 --> 00:00:05.754
ChatGPT reads the uploaded chapter · accelerated.

00:00:05.754 --> 00:00:09.254
Write the prompt · fast typing.

00:00:09.254 --> 00:00:09.624
Send the shortcut as the second message.

00:00:09.624 --> 00:00:13.684
ChatGPT processes the prompt and builds the widget · accelerated.

00:00:13.684 --> 00:00:17.377
Inspect the generated widget before using its controls.

00:00:17.385 --> 00:00:21.890
Choose the parameter update answer.

00:00:21.890 --> 00:00:25.454
Lock in the final answer and read the feedback.

00:00:25.454 --> 00:00:29.045
Continue to the second question.

00:00:29.045 --> 00:00:33.626
Select the contextual-inference explanation.

00:00:33.626 --> 00:00:39.566
Confirm and inspect why context does not update weights.

00:00:39.566 --> 00:00:43.150
Advance to the final question.

00:00:43.150 --> 00:00:47.595
Choose a comparison that keeps the model fixed.

00:00:47.595 --> 00:00:51.198
Lock the final answer and read its explanation.

00:00:51.198 --> 00:00:54.823
Show the final result after all three answers.

00:00:54.823 --> 00:01:02.100
Start a new round with the first question.
